  "classification": "New classical low-digit carrier-plan obstruction via fixed annihilators and product-residue cofactor counting; conditional nearlinear extraction from a supplied bounded cover",
  "model_authorization": "User authorized parallel Sol 6.1 research; three existing gpt-6.1-sol agents reused.",
  "previous_goal_turn": "No acquisition progress; targeted direct-query/literature and saved external-delta audit only.",
  "whole_family_soft_linear_query_acquired": false,
  "general_query_bound": "Existing soft O(J+sqrt(JL)), hence soft O(m^(3/2)), unchanged",
  "new_arithmetic_step": "Equal-position pairs or anchored triples eliminate advised carrier seed/ratio. If all integers vanish, labeled integer energy contradicts the raw light-catalog modular bound. Successful prescribed plans thus give nonzero low-digit-determined order annihilators.",
  "source_count": "Fixing h=PQ mod m^2 and P cofactor v leaves at most one Q cofactor w; O(M^.969) pairs per fixed local-prime-order pair. Sum ALL O(M) moduli, O(M^2) low products and O(M) relations: soft O(B M^4.969). No fictitious K_* modulus count.",
  "plan_scope": "Up to B<=M prescribed plans per (m,N mod m^2), k^2*T nearlinear, polylog-bit integers, arbitrary numerical origin spans; full-input/factor advice allowed for selection, seeds and ratios. Positions/origins using more digits are outside scope.",
  "source_and_energy_scope": "Same original qualified Omega(M^6/log^2 M) supply, existing energy at CURRENT candidates only. All-comparable-modulus enumeration is only a counting overestimate. New success loss soft O(M^5.969) for B<=M.",
  "conditional_extraction": "A supplied valid cover with 2E k^2 T<g^4 and T(H+4)<=8m^4 yields 0<|K|<=16m^6<m^2D. Monic block factorial mod |K| strips its cofactor; D and N mod D recover factors in soft O(m) bits under per-integer encoding promises.",
  "limits": "No cover/K acquisition or unrestricted operation lower bound. No all-semiprime sixth-rate algorithm. Full-input-dependent metadata, larger libraries, other implicit queries remain open.",
  "verification_scope": "Classical arithmetic proofs with independent mathematical/source/bit-cost reviews; no new Lean theorem, native edit, example or broad build.",
  "missing_work": "Restriction-stable soft O(m) sufficient factor query, all-input and full bit/controller proof, Lean sixth-rate composition",
